1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,060
Always be ready to survive alone. Some people suddenly change. Today you're important to them.

2
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:15,700
Tomorrow you might be nothing. Sometimes they only held you for their own benefit.

3
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:18,740
That's the ultimate truth of life.
